  "notes": "{尊|たっと}ぶ expresses valuing or respecting something highly.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nVARIANT:\nAlso read as {尊|とうと}ぶ (same meaning). Both readings are correct.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {命|いのち}を{尊|たっと}ぶ: to value life\n- {伝統|でんとう}を{尊|たっと}ぶ: to respect tradition\n- {人権|じんけん}を{尊|たっと}ぶ: to value human rights\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {尊|とうと}い/{尊|たっと}い: precious, noble (adjective)\n- {尊敬|そんけい}する: to respect (more common in everyday speech)\n- {崇|あが}める: to worship, to idolize",
